  },
  {
    "id": "source-40",
    "heading": "Chapter 1. Open Orbit",
    "anchor": "page_86",
    "start": 183070,
    "end": 187673
  },
  {
    "id": "source-41",
    "heading": "WE REMEMBER THE SKY YOU ALLOWED TO DIE. WE ASK FOR AN OPEN ORBIT AND A MEETING WITHOUT HIDDEN VOICES.",
    "anchor": "",
    "start": 187673,
    "end": 206023
  },
  {
    "id": "source-42",
    "heading": "Chapter 2. The Two Eshris",
